        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BGH100CRVSS4-CUSTOM, Curved Bighorn Stainless Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis custom Bighorn curved door pull is 1\" diameter satin stainless steel with a 60\" overall length and 48\" center to center.  It is made to customer specifications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Bighorn 100 Series Stainless Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Length: 60\" Overall</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This curved stainless steel door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Requires 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
